    "Source": "\n\/*\r\n    Author or source: ten.xmg@zlipzzuf\r\n    \n    Vaguely based on the Stilson\/Smith Moog paper, but going in a rather different direction\r\n    from others I've seen here.\n*\/\r\n\ndouble coef[9];\r\ndouble d[4];\r\ndouble omega; \/\/peak freq\r\ndouble g;     \/\/peak mag\r\n\r\n\/\/ calculating coefficients:\r\n\r\ndouble k,p,q,a;\r\ndouble a0,a1,a2,a3,a4;\r\n\nformula_main {\r\n    float isHighPass = SWITCH_1;\r\n\r\n\tomega = exp(6.2 + KNOB_1*5.6) \/ SAMPLE_RATE;\r\n\tg = 0.45 + KNOB_2 * 5;\r\n\tk=(4.0*g-3.0)\/(g+1.0);\r\n\tp=1.0-0.25*k;p*=p;\r\n\t\r\n\tif (!isHighPass) {\r\n        \/\/ LP:\r\n\t\ta=1.0\/(tan(0.5*omega)*(1.0+p));\r\n\t\tp=1.0+a;\r\n\t\tq=1.0-a;\r\n\r\n\t\ta0=1.0\/(k+p*p*p*p);\r\n\t\ta1=4.0*(k+p*p*p*q);\r\n\t\ta2=6.0*(k+p*p*q*q);\r\n\t\ta3=4.0*(k+p*q*q*q);\r\n\t\ta4=    (k+q*q*q*q);\r\n\t\tp=a0*(k+1.0);\r\n\r\n\t\tcoef[0]=p;\r\n\t\tcoef[1]=4.0*p;\r\n\t\tcoef[2]=6.0*p;\r\n\t\tcoef[3]=4.0*p;\r\n\t\tcoef[4]=p;\r\n\t\tcoef[5]=-a1*a0;\r\n\t\tcoef[6]=-a2*a0;\r\n\t\tcoef[7]=-a3*a0;\r\n\t\tcoef[8]=-a4*a0;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\telse {\r\n\t\t\/\/ or HP:\r\n\t\ta=tan(0.5*omega)\/(1.0+p);\r\n\t\tp=a+1.0;\r\n\t\tq=a-1.0;\r\n\r\n\t\ta0=1.0\/(p*p*p*p+k);\r\n\t\ta1=4.0*(p*p*p*q-k);\r\n\t\ta2=6.0*(p*p*q*q+k);\r\n\t\ta3=4.0*(p*q*q*q-k);\r\n\t\ta4=    (q*q*q*q+k);\r\n\t\tp=a0*(k+1.0);\r\n\r\n\t\tcoef[0]=p;\r\n\t\tcoef[1]=-4.0*p;\r\n\t\tcoef[2]=6.0*p;\r\n\t\tcoef[3]=-4.0*p;\r\n\t\tcoef[4]=p;\r\n\t\tcoef[5]=-a1*a0;\r\n\t\tcoef[6]=-a2*a0;\r\n\t\tcoef[7]=-a3*a0;\r\n\t\tcoef[8]=-a4*a0;\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\t\/\/ per sample:\r\n\r\n\tfloat output = coef[0]*input+d[0];\r\n\td[0]=coef[1]*input+coef[5]*output+d[1];\r\n\td[1]=coef[2]*input+coef[6]*output+d[2];\r\n\td[2]=coef[3]*input+coef[7]*output+d[3];\r\n\td[3]=coef[4]*input+coef[8]*output;\r\n\n    return output;\n}\n",
